  "prefLabel": "He-M 510.15 Interagency Coordinating Council",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-M 510.15 Interagency Coordinating Council. The purpose of the interagency coordinating council shall be to provide advice to the lead agency regarding the FCESS program. The interagency coordinating council shall be established and operated pursuant to 34 CFR Part 303, Subpart G.\n\nSource. #9594, eff 11-11-09; ss by #10325, eff 4-26-13 (from He-M 510.16); ss by #13753, eff 9-27-23",
